# A short talk with slides. Render it, then film it:
#
#   me say  examples/talk/talk.conv out/talk.flac
#   me film out/talk.flac out/talk.mp4 --page examples/talk
#
@characters
ADA:   { persona: ada, name: Ada Marsh, title: Keeper of the light }
GRACE: { persona: grace, name: Grace Okafor, title: Harbour pilot }
---
[speakers faces lower-third captions]
[slide title]
ADA: Good evening. This is the lighthouse log, read aloud.
[slide log]
GRACE: Three things are written down every night.
[slide log step:1]
GRACE: When the lamp was lit.
[slide log step:2]
GRACE: Which boats came in.
[slide log step:3]
GRACE: And what the weather did.
[slide close]
[speakers waveform captions]
ADA: That is the whole of it. Good night.
